      "description": "<p><strong>Blessings of Moradin.</strong> While attuned to the axe, you gain the following benefits:</p><div class=\"def-block\"><p><strong>Darkvision.</strong> You gain Darkvision with a range of 60 feet. If you already have Darkvision, its range increases by 60 feet.</p><p><strong>Fortitude of Stone.</strong> Your Constitution increases by 2, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Gifts of the Creator.</strong> You have proficiency with Brewer’s Supplies, Mason’s Tools, and Smith’s Tools.</p><p><strong>One with the Forge.</strong> You have Immunity to Poison damage and Resistance to Fire damage.</p><p><strong>Sunder.</strong> When you hit an object with the axe, the object takes the maximum amount of damage possible.</p></div>",
